OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 12, dies after being hit by
OL,4,Abus in Kilwinning
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 12-year-old girl has died after being
OL,7,Fhit by a bus in Ayrshire.
OL,9,FEmergency crews were called to Lauchlan
OL,10,FWay in Kilwinning after the incident,
OL,11,Fwhich happened at about 13:10.
OL,13,FPolice Scotland said the girl, who has
OL,14,Fnot been named, was pronounced dead at
OL,15,Fthe scene.
OL,17,FThe force said inquiries were ongoing
OL,18,Fand asked for anyone with information
OL,19,Fto contact officers.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
